## Design Tokens (Authoritative)

### Colors
- **Espresso (Primary dark):**
  - 900 `#140E0A` (footer, desktop title bar)
  - 800 `#1E1510` (primary text, dark cards)
  - 600 `#3D2F26` (secondary text)
  - 500 `#524135` (tertiary text)
- **Flour (Canvas):**
  - 100 `#FBF9F5` (page background)
  - 200 `#F5F1EA` (subtle surface)
  - 50 `#FDFCFB` (lightest)
- **Caramel (Warm accent):**
  - 500 `#F59E0B` (warnings, warmth)
  - 400 `#FBBF24` (highlights)
- **Culinary (Success/active):**
  - 600 `#16A34A` (active nav, primary CTA, success)
  - 400 `#4ADE80` (light accent)
- **Stone Border:** `#E6DFD5` (all 1px borders)

### Radii
- Cards: `rounded-2xl` (16px)
- Buttons/inputs: `rounded-lg` (8px) or `rounded-xl` (12px) — pick one and stay consistent
- Badges/pills: `rounded-full` (999px)

### Fonts
- Sans: `"Plus Jakarta Sans", Inter, system-ui`
- Mono: `"JetBrains Mono", monospace` — required for ALL numeric data

## Sidebar Rules (Corrected)
- Width: `w-64` (256px) desktop, `w-full` mobile
- Background: `bg-white` (NOT dark)
- Border: `border-r border-stoneBorder/80`
- Active item: `bg-culinary-600 text-white rounded-xl shadow-sm`
- Inactive item: `text-espresso-600 hover:bg-flour-100 hover:text-espresso-800`
- Logo: 40x40 svg tile + wordmark, `border-b border-stoneBorder/60` separator

## Dashboard Layout Rules (Corrected)
- Main content: `bg-[#F8F9FA]` (dashboard body) with `p-6 lg:p-8`
- Metric KPI grid: `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4`
- Metric card: `bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stoneBorder shadow-sm p-4`
- Metric structure: Icon badge (top-left) + badge pill (top-right) → Big number (font-mono) + unit label → Footer with link

## Dark Surfaces (Only These Are Dark)
- Footer: `bg-espresso-900`
- Simulated desktop title bar: `bg-espresso-900`
- Dark mode logo preview card: `bg-espresso-900`
- **Everything else on the dashboard is LIGHT.**

